{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917850/extras/c6867639fdab2cd17342b8561a11f263.poster.avif?t=1765631210\" width=800 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917850/extras/c6867639fdab2cd17342b8561a11f263.webm?t=1765631210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917850/extras/c6867639fdab2cd17342b8561a11f263.mp4?t=1765631210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\ud83d\udd25 Referee Life Simulator 2026 \u2013 Experience the Game from the Whistle's Perspective!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the shoes of a real football referee</strong> in this immersive and realistic referee simulator. Make tough decisions, control the tempo of the match, and handle intense moments on the pitch with confidence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfdf\ufe0f Whether it's a controversial offside, a heated red card, or a last-minute penalty \u2013 the outcome is in your hands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917850/extras/d627b064212f3418590fe4326612c018.poster.avif?t=1765631210\" width=800 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917850/extras/d627b064212f3418590fe4326612c018.webm?t=1765631210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917850/extras/d627b064212f3418590fe4326612c018.mp4?t=1765631210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2699\ufe0f Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26bd <strong>Realistic Football Matches</strong> \u2013 Dynamic AI-controlled teams and realistic match scenarios.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udfe5 <strong>Issue Cards &amp; Make VAR Calls</strong> \u2013 Use yellow/red cards, and interact with a working VAR system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0a <strong>Whistle Commands &amp; Voice Reactions</strong> \u2013 Control the flow of the game with authentic audio.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc6e <strong>Referee Career Mode</strong> \u2013 Start as an amateur and climb the ranks to become a top-level official.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Decision-Making Mechanics</strong> \u2013 Test your reflexes and football knowledge in real time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Multiple Stadiums &amp; Environments</strong> \u2013 From small-town derbies to World Cup finals.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917850/extras/0abc553ff5b32af48e4f9e877ba24bae.poster.avif?t=1765631210\" width=800 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917850/extras/0abc553ff5b32af48e4f9e877ba24bae.webm?t=1765631210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917850/extras/0abc553ff5b32af48e4f9e877ba24bae.mp4?t=1765631210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just another football game \u2013 <strong>this is the game from the referee\u2019s perspective</strong>. Whether you're a fan of tactical gameplay, simulation experiences, or football itself, <strong>Football Referee Simulator</strong> offers a unique challenge unlike anything else on the field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <i>Control the match. Feel the pressure. Blow t